    <h1>Programs and Classes</h1>
    <h2>Little Dribblers (Under 5)</h2>
    <p>Introduction to basketball through fun games and activities that develop basic motor skills and hand-eye coordination.</p>
    <h2>Mini Hoopers (Under 7)</h2>
    <p>Focus on basic basketball skills like dribbling, passing, and shooting in a playful and interactive setting.</p>
    <h2>Junior Hoopers (Under 10)</h2>
    <p>More structured training with drills and exercises to refine fundamental skills, teamwork, and understanding of the game.</p>
    <h2>Future Stars (Under 12)</h2>
    <p>Advanced training focusing on strategy, in-depth skills development, and preparing for competitive play.</p>
